  "body": "• Brand New & Freehold: Standalone construction on a 275m² (mol) section\r\n•  Flexible 4–5 Bedroom Layout: 4 double bedrooms plus a top-floor lounge or optional 5th bedroom\r\n•  Top Floor Living: Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and main lounge on the upper level\r\n•  Sea Views: Large ranch sliders opening to a sunny top-floor balcony\r\n•  Quality Build: Durable weatherboard and fibre-cement cladding, double glazing, and premium finishes\r\n•  Practical Garaging: Double internal-access garage, separate laundry space, and off-street parking\r\n•  Prime Coastal Location: Minutes to Rothesay Bay beach, local cafés, coastal walks, and shops\r\n•  Top School Zones: Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and Browns Bay Primary School\r\n\r\nTucked in a private position within this boutique new development, 44C Braemar Road is a beautifully appointed freehold home offering contemporary design, flexible living options and elevated coastal views.\r\n\r\nDesigned across an intuitive split-level layout, this four-to-five-bedroom, three-bathroom floor plan offers an innovative reversed design that maximises sunshine, natural light and surrounding views.\r\n\r\nThe lower level accommodates two bright double bedrooms serviced by a stylish family bathroom, creating an ideal separate zone for teenagers, long-term guests or a quiet home office. A double internal-access garage, dedicated laundry space and additional off-street parking complete this functional ground floor.\r\n\r\nThe mid-level is dedicated to peaceful accommodation. Here, a spacious master suite features its own private ensuite and a balcony with views. An additional double bedroom on this level is serviced by a second full bathroom, ensuring fantastic comfort and convenience for the entire household.\r\n\r\nThe top level serves as the ultimate high point of the home, designed for light-filled living and effortless entertaining. A sleek, modern kitchen forms the heart of the open-plan dining and main living zone, where large ranch sliders open wide to a sunny balcony showcasing elevated views. Adding exceptional versatility, an adjoining lounge space on this floor can serve as a second living room, media area, or be utilised as a spacious fifth bedroom to suit your family’s needs.\r\n\r\nConstructed for easy modern living, the home features durable weatherboard and fibre-cement cladding, double glazing and quality finishes throughout, set on a standalone 275m² (mol) freehold section offering complete peace of mind.\r\n\r\nThe location delivers the ultimate Rothesay Bay lifestyle, with beaches, coastal walks, cafés and boutique shops all just moments away. Top-tier education is guaranteed, with zoning for Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Browns Bay Primary School.\r\n\r\nBrand new, freehold and smartly designed with flexible living options, 44C Braemar Road presents a magnificent opportunity to secure a premium home in a highly desired Rothesay Bay setting. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing—your dream Rothesay Bay lifestyle awaits.\r\n\r\nPlease note: The property is currently vacant. The furniture and décor shown in the photos were used for staging purposes only and are not included in the sale.",
